changes.body:
`bee setup` now refreshes only the native `bee-attention` saved query in the selected database. It
accepts the normal `--beads-db`/`BEADS_DB` selection without requiring a permanent tracker checkout.
It neither reads, validates nor writes BV recipes and needs no BV executable.

The `bee_setup` success receipt contains `repository` and `preset` alongside `ok` and `kind`;
`recipes` is removed. Setup failures retain `repository`, `presetRemoved` and `presetInstalled`;
`recipesInstalled` is removed. Inspect confirmed preset effects before retrying.
